---
import FAQSection from "./FAQSection.astro";

interface Props {
  faq: Array<{ question: string; answer: string }>;
}

const { faq } = Astro.props;
---
<!-- ====================================================
PANEL: SHARP AFTER DARK
==================================================== -->
<div id="panel-sharp-after-dark" class="panel" aria-hidden="false">
<div class="panel-inner">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-start">

<div>
<p class="sub-eyebrow">Restaurants &middot; Hotels &middot; Commercial Kitchens</p>
<h2 class="sub-headline-pink text-4xl lg:text-5xl mb-6">Sharp After Dark</h2>
<p class="sub-body mb-6">After service, you rest. Before prep, they're sharp. Sharp After Dark schedules collection from 8 PM&ndash;1 AM and return from 3 AM&ndash;8 AM around your kitchen's preferred timing.</p>
<p class="sub-body mb-10 text-sm" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.32);">Every window is confirmed in advance based on location, route, and availability. No on-call guessing. No disruption to the line.</p>

<div class="mb-10">
<div class="feature-item">
<div class="feature-dot-pink"></div>
<div><div class="text-white/80 text-[21px] font-semibold mb-1 tracking-wide">8 PM&ndash;1 AM Collection &middot; 3 AM&ndash;8 AM Return</div><div class="text-white/38 text-[18px] font-light leading-relaxed">Choose the preferred window for your operation. MKG confirms the appointment around the route and your kitchen rhythm.</div></div>
</div>
<div class="feature-item">
<div class="feature-dot-pink"></div>
<div><div class="text-white/80 text-[21px] font-semibold mb-1 tracking-wide">Fleet Management &amp; Tracking</div><div class="text-white/38 text-[18px] font-light leading-relaxed">Complete accountability for your knife inventory. Every blade tracked, documented, and returned to spec.</div></div>
</div>
<div class="feature-item">
<div class="feature-dot-pink"></div>
<div><div class="text-white/80 text-[21px] font-semibold mb-1 tracking-wide">Scheduled Recurring Programs</div><div class="text-white/38 text-[18px] font-light leading-relaxed">Weekly, bi-weekly, or monthly programs keep the question off your kitchen's plate. The knives are sharp when the line needs them.</div></div>
</div>
<div class="feature-item">
<div class="feature-dot-pink"></div>
<div><div class="text-white/80 text-[21px] font-semibold mb-1 tracking-wide">Repair, Chip Work &amp; Restoration</div><div class="text-white/38 text-[18px] font-light leading-relaxed">Damaged tips, chipped edges, and worn profiles corrected on the same cycle. Tools restored, not just maintained.</div></div>
</div>
</div>

<section class="sad-steak-module" aria-label="Steak knife service for restaurants">
<p class="sad-steak-eyebrow">The Guest-Facing Edge</p>
<h3 class="sad-steak-title">Steak knife service for restaurants.</h3>
<div class="sad-steak-control-list" aria-hidden="true">
<span>The plate is controlled.</span>
<span>The pacing is controlled.</span>
<span>The glassware is controlled.</span>
</div>
<p class="sad-steak-question">Is the steak knife?</p>
<p class="sad-steak-body">
Every cut matters, including the one the guest makes.
</p>
<div class="sad-steak-actions">
<a href="/book/restaurant/" class="panel-cta-btn panel-cta-pink">Service the Dining Room</a>
<a href="/steak-knife-sharpening-miami-restaurants/" class="panel-cta-btn panel-cta-ghost">Ask About Steak Knife Care</a>
</div>
</section>

<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
<a href="/book/restaurant/" class="panel-cta-btn panel-cta-pink">Book Restaurant Service</a>
<a href="/contact/" class="panel-cta-btn panel-cta-ghost">Ask a Question &rarr;</a>
</div>
</div>

<div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
<div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded border border-pink-900/20 bg-black">
<img src="/images/services/gemini-table.webp" class="w-full h-[280px] object-cover opacity-60" alt="Sharp After Dark service" loading="lazy" width="600" height="280">
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
<div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-px" style="background:rgba(236,72,153,0.22)"></div>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3">
<div class="text-center p-4 border border-white/5 rounded">
<div class="text-[36px] font-bold text-pink-400 mb-1">17+</div>
<div class="text-[13.5px] uppercase tracking-widest text-white/28 font-semibold">Yrs Experience</div>
</div>
<div class="text-center p-4 border border-white/5 rounded">
<div class="text-[36px] font-bold text-pink-400 mb-1">0</div>
<div class="text-[13.5px] uppercase tracking-widest text-white/28 font-semibold">Kitchen Downtime</div>
</div>
<div class="text-center p-4 border border-white/5 rounded">
<div class="text-[36px] font-bold text-pink-400 mb-1">200k+</div>
<div class="text-[13.5px] uppercase tracking-widest text-white/28 font-semibold">Knives Sharpened</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-4 border border-pink-900/20 rounded bg-black/30">
<p class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-white/22 font-bold mb-2">Perfect Edge Legacy &middot; Bay Area</p>
<p class="text-white/42 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">Selected Bay Area hospitality clients served during Sean&rsquo;s years with Perfect Edge: The French Laundry &middot; Four Seasons &middot; The Ritz-Carlton &middot; Hotel Nikko &middot; Lolinda &middot; Zuni Caf&eacute; &middot; Niku Steakhouse &middot; Bourbon Steak</p>
</div>
</div>

</div>
<FAQSection items={faq} accent="pink" class="mt-14 pt-10 border-t border-white/5" />
</div>
</div><!-- /panel-sharp-after-dark -->
